Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:25:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] NumericalEarth fjp/net-inflow-0.9.4 (fjp/net-inflow
 merged with v0.9.4), and two configs to check the merge alone

The [sources] pin and the Manifest entry move to fjp/net-inflow-0.9.4 (tree 3ce8f0b; same dependencies and
extensions as before, so Pkg.instantiate only fetches the new NumericalEarth). v0.9.4 brings GEUS solid ice discharge
and GloFAS river mouths (for the later switch to ERA5), and changes two things even with JRA55: the shortwave absorbed
in the top cell enters as a surface flux (#605), and river water is shared by depth over its footprint (#917).
config_smoke_test_ne094.toml (100 km, 4 days) first, then config_sep2005_4mo_nemo_glorys12_nz100_ne094.toml, the twin
of the four-month NEMO run of 24 Nov.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
